# Nothing but the v1.0 handoff belongs in "project plan/" — a 60MB Go installer
# was once swept in by `git add -A`. The folder is the immutable specification
# package and every file in it is hash-verified against its MANIFEST.
# The v1.0 handoff and nothing else. Downloads keep landing here — a 60MB Go
# installer once, an unrelated PDF since. The eight specification files are
# hash-verified against MANIFEST.md; anything else in this directory is an
# accident and must never reach the repository.
project plan/*
!project plan/*.md
!project plan/*.yaml
!project plan/*.json
!project plan/*.sql
*.msi
